WEBVTT

00:11:26.973 --> 00:11:30.110
We cannot burn it without causing

00:11:30.110 --> 00:11:32.375
desertification and climate change.

00:11:32.375 --> 00:11:36.360
What are we going to do?

00:11:38.420 --> 00:11:40.810
There is only one option,

00:11:40.810 --> 00:11:43.671
I'll repeat to you, only one option

00:11:43.671 --> 00:11:46.390
left to climatologists and scientists,

00:11:46.390 --> 00:11:49.318
and that is to do the unthinkable,

00:11:49.318 --> 00:11:52.054
and to use livestock,

00:11:52.054 --> 00:11:55.009
bunched and moving,

00:11:55.009 --> 00:11:58.398
as a proxy for former herds and predators,

00:11:58.398 --> 00:12:00.142
and mimic nature.